UID:detective-conan-l-ange-dechu-de-l-asphalte-55011@pathe.fr
DESCRIPTION:Conan Edogawa and his friends head to Kanagawa for the Motorcy
 cle Festival. On the way\, a mysterious black motorcycle suddenly appears
 \, speeding out of control and even leaping over their vehicle. Pursuing i
 t is the “Goddess of the Wind\,” Kanagawa Traffic Police officer Chiha
 ya Hagiwara. Despite her relentless chase\, the rider escapes\, leaving he
 r motorcycle heavily damaged.
